// MS Portal - datovy model
// Klicova zasada: KAZDY dotaz na Order/Project v aplikacnim kodu je filtrovan
// podle companyId odvozeneho ze session (nikdy z parametru pozadavku).

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

enum Role {
  CLIENT // uzivatel klientske firmy
  ADMIN  // interni pracovnik MEDIA SPACE
}

enum OrderStatus {
  NEW         // nova
  CONFIRMED   // potvrzena
  IN_PROGRESS // v realizaci
  DONE        // hotovo
  CANCELLED   // zrusena
}

enum CaflouSyncStatus {
  SKIPPED // Caflou zatim neni napojene (chybi API klic)
  PENDING // ceka na zalozeni projektu v Caflou
  OK      // projekt v Caflou uspesne zalozen
  ERROR   // zalozeni se nezdarilo, potreba rucni zasah v adminu
}

model Company {
  id             String    @id @default(cuid())
  name           String
  ratePerPage    Int       // predbezna sazba za 1 normostranu, v Kc
  caflouTag      String?   // presny nazev stitku v Caflou, kterym jsou oznaceny projekty teto firmy
  driveFolderUrl String?   // odkaz na slozku klienta na Google Disku (prirazuje admin rucne)
  active         Boolean   @default(true)
  createdAt      DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt      DateTime  @updatedAt

  users    User[]
  orders   Order[]
  projects Project[]
}

model User {
  id           String    @id @default(cuid())
  email        String    @unique
  passwordHash String
  name         String?
  role         Role      @default(CLIENT)
  companyId    String?   // null pro interni ADMIN ucty
  company      Company?  @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id])
  active       Boolean   @default(true)
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())

  orders Order[] @relation("OrderCreatedBy")
}

model Order {
  id                  String            @id @default(cuid())
  companyId           String
  company             Company           @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id])
  createdByUserId     String
  createdBy           User              @relation("OrderCreatedBy", fields: [createdByUserId], references: [id])

  title               String
  pageCount           Int?
  ratePerPageSnapshot Int?              // sazba v okamziku objednavky (pro dohledatelnost, i kdyz se sazba klienta pozdeji zmeni)
  priceEstimate        Int?             // predbezna cena = pageCount * ratePerPageSnapshot
  deadline             DateTime?
  note                 String?
  preferredNarrator    String?          // "Preferovany herec" - preni klienta, MEDIA SPACE ho pak potvrdi nebo zmeni
  attachmentUrl        String?
  attachmentName       String?

  status               OrderStatus       @default(NEW)
  emailSentAt          DateTime?

  caflouProjectId      String?
  caflouSyncStatus     CaflouSyncStatus  @default(SKIPPED)
  caflouSyncError      String?

  project              Project?

  createdAt            DateTime          @default(now())
  updatedAt             DateTime          @updatedAt
}

// Lokalni cache projektu - dokud neni napojena plna synchronizace s Caflou,
// zaznam vznika pri kazde objednavce. Pozdeji pribyde import existujicich
// projektu z Caflou podle caflouTag firmy.
model Project {
  id              String    @id @default(cuid())
  companyId       String
  company         Company   @relation(fields: [companyId], references: [id])

  orderId         String?   @unique
  order           Order?    @relation(fields: [orderId], references: [id])

  name            String
  status          String?   // napr. Nove / V realizaci / Hotovo - z Caflou nebo rucne
  narrator        String?   // "Herec"
  finishDate      DateTime?
  releaseDate     DateTime?

  caflouProjectId String?   @unique

  createdAt       DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime  @updatedAt
}
